      "content": "i haven't heard of a \"garden shed\" exception in the Austin code specifically, so i'll have to double check that. in the meantime, if the board does decide to be strict about the boundary, how should i handle the language regarding \"encroachment\" in the formal filing? i want to make sure we don't make it sound like the neighboring structure is a permanent \"infringement\" on our territory, which might trigger a more aggressive enforcement action from the city.",
